{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111740/extras/dcbff32223c631627a4aec3f7693beb0.avif?t=1763311225\" width=1200 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25<strong><i>Game Features</i></strong>\ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728<strong>7 Goddesses, 7 Fantasies</strong> \ud83d\udc8b Big tits, juicy asses, chocolate-skinned divas, beast-girls... take them all and ascend to heaven\ud83d\ude0d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728<strong>30+ fully animated Live2D sex scenes</strong> \ud83d\udca6 Real-time jiggle physics, explosive motion, and enough bounce to break reality\ud83d\udca6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728<strong>Time-limited match-3 combat</strong> \u26a1 Every second counts \u2014 only those with \u201csolo training\u201d reflexes can reach the climax\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc4c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728<strong>Face-sitting ultimates &amp; legendary toys</strong> \ud83d\udc95 Including the <strong>\u201cTime Stopper\u201d</strong> \u2014 Yes, it works. Yes, it\u2019s every man\u2019s dream. Yes, SOD is canon\ud83d\udc95</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728<strong>6 story routes + 7 hidden paths</strong> \ud83d\udd13 Sinful goddesses, forbidden kinks, and no mercy for sanity\ud83d\udd13</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728<strong>Over-the-top chuuni chaos</strong> \ud83e\udd0c No balance, no logic, no strategy, only raw lust, dumb power, and beautiful madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111740/extras/f49167f07f0833fcd28c3f103822b354.poster.avif?t=1763311225\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111740/extras/f49167f07f0833fcd2